{"indicator":"export/gas","unit":"公噸","years":[1995,1996,1997,1998,1999,2000,2001,2002,2003,2004,2005,2006,2007,2008,2009,2010,2011,2012,2013,2014,2015,2016,2017,2018,2019,2020,2021,2022,2023,2024],"notes":{"TWN":"BACI 的台灣（「Other Asia, nes」）是貿易夥伴申報的數字，台灣不向聯合國申報，而且這個代碼不全是台灣（委內瑞拉 2011–2013 年記到這裡的原油，台灣當年其實很少買）；能源署的進口來源見側欄。","IRN":"BACI 只有進口國的申報，2023、2024 年沒有國家申報從伊朗進口原油，伊朗的原油出口是 0；一般認為這些原油經由轉運改記成其他國家的出口（例如馬來西亞）。","MYS":"馬來西亞的原油出口 2022 年起大增（2024 年對中國約 5,450 萬公噸），一般認為含轉運的伊朗原油。","ZAF":"1999 年以前是南部非洲關稅同盟（南非、波札那、賴索托、納米比亞、史瓦帝尼）的合計。","BEL":"比利時的管道天然氣出口大多是過境再出口。"},"notesEn":{"TWN":"Taiwan in BACI (\"Other Asia, nes\") is based on its partners' reports, as Taiwan does not report to the UN, and the code is not only Taiwan (Venezuela booked crude to it in 2011–2013, when Taiwan bought little); Energy Administration import sources are in the side panel.","IRN":"BACI relies on importers' reports here; no country reported crude imports from Iran in 2023 or 2024, so Iran's crude exports are zero. These cargoes are widely thought to be relabelled as other countries' exports (Malaysia, for example) after ship-to-ship transfers.","MYS":"Malaysia's crude exports jump from 2022 (about 54.5 million tonnes to China in 2024), widely thought to include transshipped Iranian crude.","ZAF":"Before 2000, the Southern African Customs Union (South Africa, Botswana, Lesotho, Namibia, Eswatini) combined.","BEL":"Belgium's pipeline gas exports are mostly re-exports of gas in transit."},"encoding":"delta","aggregates":{"WLD":[4,6878,1047,887,-238,719,1206,7,688,1927,-259,1499,2228,350,1303,-1000,6037,1764,-2300,122,3880,-1477,3470,3194,-334,4525,-3208,5229,-996,588,-80]},"values":{"ABW":[-3,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,3816000,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,-3812888,null,null,null,null,null],"AFG":[0,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,28,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],"A